org, Sweden. The defending champion, " [:a {:href "/athletes/68666"} "Sally Gunnell"] ", was back and was a threat, but she was slightly injured and did not finish her semi-final. Hemmings and Batten led the qualifiers in the semi-finals, and Tonja Buford-Bailey also qualified easily. Hemmings took the lead from the second hurdle. Batten was in the lane outside her and she almost made up the stagger on her on the backstretch. But by the eighth hurdle, Batten, Hemmings and Buford-Bailey were virtually even. Hemmings then put the hammer down, pulling away on the run-in, and won the race by 2-3 metres, with Batten getting the silver medal over her teammate."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3473"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/72215"} "Deon Hemmings"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JAM"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JAM.png"}] "JAM"]] [:td {} "54.70 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "52.99 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "52.82 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3817"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77756"} "Kim Batten"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "54.92 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "53.65 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "53.08 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3822"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77778"} "Tonja Buford"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "p